OL,3,ARussell Brand prison message denying
OL,4,Arape 'appalling' and being
OL,5,Ainvestigated, No 10 says
OL,6,
OL,7,FRussell Brand's message to his podcast
OL,8,Ffollowers in which he claimed he was
OL,9,Finnocent of sex offences he has been
OL,10,Fconvicted of was "clearly appalling"
OL,11,Fand is being urgently investigated,
OL,12,FDowning Street has said.
OL,14,FBrand has been convicted of rape and
OL,15,Fthree counts of sexual assault, and is
OL,16,Fserving a 10-and-half-year sentence. He
OL,17,Fis currently being held at HMP
OL,18,FLittlehey in Cambridgeshire.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
